		"name": "CPAFlow AI — KAN-17 Manage Campaign Expenses",
		"description": "End-to-end Postman verification for KAN-17: Manage campaign expenses (CRUD).\n\nTests the authenticated campaign expenses endpoints: create, list, update, delete.\nCovers validation, authorization, nested-resource security, and response shape.\nUses real HTTP requests against the local CPAFlow API.\nRun with: npx newman run <collection> -e <env>",
